            "question": "When does the sale start and end?",
            "answer": "The sale starts at 12:00 AM (midnight) IST on 27 November 2026 and ends at 11:59 PM IST on 30 November 2026, or when stocks run out, whichever is earlier.\nSale prices apply only to orders placed and paid within the sale period. Orders placed before or after it are charged regular prices."
