          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When will the sale prices be revealed?",
            "answer": "At 12:00 AM IST on 27 November, when the sale goes live. Until then you can browse the products on this page."
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Which products are included?",
            "answer": "Only these 21 products: Seabuckthorn Pulp, Seabuckthorn Oil, Seabuckthorn Oil Capsules, Pahadi Badri Cow Ghee, Shilajit, Lakadong Turmeric, Buransh, Strawberry Lime Squash, Hing, Walnuts, Almonds, Ing Makhir Ginger, Dried Seabuckthorn Berries, Seabuckthorn Powder, Seabuckthorn Leaves, Honey, Kashmiri Red Chilli, Rosemary Oil, Lavender Oil, Lemongrass Oil and Kashmiri Garlic.\nSale prices apply only to the sizes and packs shown at the sale price on each product page. Everything else on the website is sold at its regular price."
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will a product stay in stock for the whole sale?",
            "answer": "Not always. Stock is limited and sold first come, first served. A product may go out of stock before the sale ends, and we are not obliged to restock it at the sale price."
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do prices include GST?",
            "answer": "Yes, all prices include applicable GST unless stated otherwise. Your final price, including any shipping charge, is shown at checkout before you pay."
          }
        },
        "faq_6": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What are the shipping charges?",
            "answer": "Orders with a cart value of ₹449 or more ship free. Orders below ₹449 have a ₹50 shipping charge.\nCart value is worked out after sale discounts and before shipping."
          }
        },
        "faq_7": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long will delivery take?",
            "answer": "Delivery timelines shown on the website are estimates. Because of high order volumes during the sale, dispatch and delivery may take longer than usual."
          }
        },
        "faq_8": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I cancel or change my order?",
            "answer": "No. Sale orders cannot be cancelled once confirmed, and we cannot change them after confirmation. Please check your cart, product size, quantity, delivery address and contact details before you place your order.\nWe may cancel an order if a product becomes unavailable, there is a pricing or listing error, your pincode is not serviceable, or we suspect fraudulent or bulk/reseller activity. If we do, we will tell you and refund the full amount for the cancelled product(s) to your original payment method."
          }
        },
        "faq_9": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I get a refund?",
            "answer": "Sale products are not eligible for refunds, including for change of mind, taste or personal preference, or choosing the wrong product.\nThis does not limit your rights under the Consumer Protection Act, 2019 and the Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules, 2020. If we cannot provide a replacement, or the law requires a refund, we will refund the amount paid for the affected product(s) to your original payment method."
          }
        },
        "faq_10": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if my order arrives damaged, wrong, missing or expired?",
            "answer": "We will replace a product that arrives damaged in transit (for example a broken jar or bottle, leakage, or packaging crushed or torn so the product is damaged), or one that is wrong, missing from your order, or expired on delivery.\nContact us within 48 hours of delivery with your order number and clear photos of the outer package, shipping label and damaged product. An unboxing video is recommended and helps us process your request faster.\nKeep the product and its original packaging until your request is resolved, as we or our courier partner may need to inspect or collect it. Once verified, we send a replacement of the same product at no extra cost. If it is out of stock, we refund the amount paid for it.\nRequests made after 48 hours, or without enough proof, may not be accepted."
          }
        },
        "faq_11": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is there a limit on how much I can buy?",
            "answer": "We may limit the quantity of any sale product per customer or per order so more people get a chance to buy. Sale offers cannot be exchanged for cash and are non-transferable."
          }
        },
        "faq_12": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why does my product look slightly different from the photo?",
            "answer": "Product images are for illustration. Natural products such as honey, ghee, spices, dry fruits and oils can vary slightly in colour, texture, aroma and taste between batches. This natural variation is not a defect."
          }
        },
